{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"导出函子"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"导出函子"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>导出函子是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Abel范畴","text":"Abel 范畴"}},{"Plain":"之间的左正合或右正合函子 $f\\colon \\mathcal A\\to\\mathcal B$ 根据"},{"Local":{"url":"导出范畴","text":"导出范畴"}},{"Plain":"的泛性质诱导的"},{"Local":{"url":"导出范畴","text":"导出范畴"}},{"Plain":"之间的函子 $\\mathsf{D}(\\mathcal A) \\to \\mathsf{D}(\\mathcal B)$.</p>\n<p>传统的导出函子是导出范畴之间的函子再复合同伦群函子 $\\mathsf{D}(\\mathcal B)\\to\\mathcal B$ 回到原来的范畴.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"整体截面","text":"整体截面"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"导出前推","text":"导出前推"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"导出张量积","text":"导出张量积"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}